   "error_s": 0.28,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Look, the new has come",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.57,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Throw the curtains open, let the morning in",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.59,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Every day a first day, every page begin",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.55,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I don't have to carry what he carried on the cross",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.53,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
